                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Country Delight's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Direct-from-farm supply chain + subscription-first + trust engineering + cold-chain infrastructure. Multi-decade compounding advantage.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new dairy D2C brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in city / regional / specialty niching. Country Delight dominates mainstream. Specialty (A2, organic, regional) + city-specific opportunities exist.</p>
                                        <h3>Is dairy subscription sustainable?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — daily consumption + predictable + trust-required. Subscription attach rates 60-80% possible. Highly LTV-favorable model.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest dairy D2C lesson?</h3>
